8975+ 834D              ;OUT=A=0 directory, A=1 file, A=2 NLST unknown type,
8976+ 834D              ;      A=3 LIST full/malformed, A=4 synthetic ".."
8977+ 834D              ;
8978+ 834D              ;No temporary zero is written into the directory. The parser uses the stored
8979+ 834D              ;16-bit item length as its boundary, so an item/name may cross 16K pages and
8980+ 834D              ;may also be longer than 255 bytes.
